==Description==
'''Side Eye Polar Bear''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from [[The Final Act Event]]. It was obtained from Level 28 of the regular track, which had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|945}} or {{Robux|161}} ({{Robux|128}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale) to unlock, with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|12,105}} or {{Robux|2,722}} ({{Robux|2,166}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale).

==Appearance==
'''Side Eye Polar Bear''' showcases the {{Color|FinalAct|Polar Bear}} [[Freezer]] giving a disapproving glance from its side.

